Package: naan
Architecture: any
Depends:
    ${shlibs:Depends},
    ${misc:Depends}
Description: compute a number from a name
 naan hashes each name and prints one decimal number:
 (digest(NAME) mod DIV) + BIAS. SHA-256 is the default hash;
 profiles set common DIV/BIAS ranges (byte, word, dword, wm).
